Input: {"question": "Which country is Summer Crush from?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 59, "text": "**Greek TV Series \"Summer Crush\" Takes the World by Storm**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 61, "end": 249, "text": "Athens, Greece - In a surprise move, Greece has emerged as the unlikely hub of international television production, with its latest export, \"Summer Crush,\" captivating audiences worldwide."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 250, "end": 491, "text": "The romantic drama series, which premiered on Greek television last summer, has been snapped up by major networks in the United States, Europe, and Asia, leaving industry insiders and viewers alike wondering what's behind its sudden success."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 492, "end": 668, "text": "\"Summer Crush\" follows the lives of a group of young Greeks as they navigate love, friendship, and family secrets against the stunning backdrop of Greece's picturesque islands."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 669, "end": 867, "text": "The show's creator, Athens-born writer-director Sophia Papadopoulos, attributes the series' global appeal to its authentic portrayal of Greek culture and the universal themes that transcend borders."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 868, "end": 1027, "text": "\"I think people are drawn to the warmth and hospitality of the Greek people, as well as the breathtaking scenery,\" Papadopoulos said in an exclusive interview."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1028, "end": 1159, "text": "\"But at its core, 'Summer Crush' is a story about human connection, and that's something that resonates with audiences everywhere.\""}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1160, "end": 1276, "text": "The show's lead actress, 25-year-old Maria Georgiou, who plays the role of Sophia, a free-spirited islander, agrees."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1277, "end": 1360, "text": "\"Greece is a country that's all about family, love, and living life to the fullest."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1361, "end": 1469, "text": "I think that's what people are responding to – the sense of community and joy that permeates every episode.\""}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1470, "end": 1660, "text": "According to data from the Greek National Broadcasting Council, \"Summer Crush\" has become the highest-rated Greek television series of all time, with over 2 million viewers tuning in weekly."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1661, "end": 1838, "text": "The show's international popularity has also led to a surge in tourism, with travel agencies reporting a 20% increase in bookings to Greece's islands since the series premiered."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1839, "end": 1997, "text": "Industry experts point to the show's unique blend of traditional Greek music, stunning cinematography, and relatable characters as key factors in its success."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1998, "end": 2174, "text": "\"Summer Crush\" has also sparked a renewed interest in Greek culture, with fans around the world taking to social media to share their own experiences and connections to Greece."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2175, "end": 2334, "text": "As the show prepares to enter its second season, Papadopoulos and her team are already fielding offers from major streaming platforms and production companies."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2335, "end": 2537, "text": "When asked about the secret to \"Summer Crush\"'s success, Papadopoulos smiled, \"It's simple – we're telling a story that's true to who we are as Greeks, and the world is responding to that authenticity.\""}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 68, "text": "Title: The French Connection: Unraveling the Origins of Summer Crush"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 70, "end": 295, "text": "In the realm of television, few shows have captured the hearts of audiences like Summer Crush, a mesmerizing series that has left viewers spellbound with its captivating storylines, stunning visuals, and memorable characters."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 296, "end": 366, "text": "But have you ever wondered where this enchanting show originated from?"}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 367, "end": 515, "text": "The answer lies in the picturesque country of France, a nation renowned for its rich cultural heritage, breathtaking landscapes, and artistic flair."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 516, "end": 661, "text": "As we delve into the world of Summer Crush, it becomes evident that the show's creators drew inspiration from the very essence of French culture."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 662, "end": 836, "text": "The series' protagonist, a free-spirited young woman named Sophie, embodies the quintessential French joie de vivre, exuding a carefree charm that is quintessentially Gallic."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 837, "end": 1039, "text": "Her adventures, set against the backdrop of the French Riviera, evoke the sun-kissed beaches, crystal-clear waters, and picturesque villages that have made France a haven for tourists and artists alike."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1040, "end": 1154, "text": "One of the most compelling pieces of evidence supporting Summer Crush's French origins lies in its cinematography."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1155, "end": 1348, "text": "The show's breathtaking visuals, which transport viewers to the idyllic French countryside, are reminiscent of the works of French New Wave directors like Jean-Luc Godard and François Truffaut."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1349, "end": 1577, "text": "The use of soft, golden lighting, coupled with the deliberate pacing and introspective narrative, pays homage to the cinematic traditions of France, a country that has produced some of the most influential filmmakers in history."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1578, "end": 1713, "text": "Furthermore, the show's themes of love, identity, and self-discovery are deeply rooted in French literary and philosophical traditions."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1714, "end": 1904, "text": "The character of Sophie, with her existential crises and romantic entanglements, is a nod to the likes of Simone de Beauvoir and Jean-Paul Sartre, who explored similar themes in their works."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1905, "end": 2125, "text": "The show's exploration of the human condition, with all its complexities and contradictions, is a testament to the French intellectual tradition, which has long been fascinated by the intricacies of the human experience."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2126, "end": 2264, "text": "In addition, the show's soundtrack, featuring a mix of French pop and indie music, adds another layer of authenticity to its French roots."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2265, "end": 2432, "text": "The use of artists like Phoenix, M, and Christine and the Queens, who are all staples of the French music scene, creates a sonic landscape that is unmistakably French."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2433, "end": 2578, "text": "The show's score, with its lush instrumentation and wistful melodies, evokes the romanticism and sensuality that are hallmarks of French culture."}}, "original_cards": [], "current_answers": ["Greece", "France"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Greece", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "France", "origin": "initial"}]}
